OL,3,GNEWSAGiant statue of Roman emperor once
OL,4,Astood in southern Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA giant gilded statue of a Roman
OL,7,Femperor once stood proudly in the heart
OL,8,Fof the Scottish Borders, new research
OL,9,Fsuggests.
OL,11,FIt had previously been assumed that a
OL,12,Fbronze leg found in a bog in Milsington
OL,13,Fnear Hawick in 1820 was loot taken from
OL,14,Fa site further south - possibly York.
OL,16,FHowever, experts now believe it came
OL,17,Ffrom a sculpture of Antoninus Pius on
OL,18,Fhorseback - similar to the one of his
OL,19,Fsuccessor Marcus Aurelius in Rome - and
OL,20,Fwas erected to mark the conquest of
OL,21,Fsouthern Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
