OL,3,GNEWSAGiant statue of Roman emperor once
OL,4,Astood in southern Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Fraser Hunter, principal curator of
OL,7,Fprehistoric and Roman archaeology at
OL,8,FNational Museums Scotland (NMS), said:
OL,9,F"This really turns on its head our
OL,10,Funderstanding of Rome's second attempt
OL,11,Fat conquering Scotland."
